# The smugglers' trade (scripts/check_smugglers.sh): the setup
# (dune_story_setup=smugglers) lands at Tuono-Pyons, talks to the smuggler
# (the offer, ARGUE, ACCEPT), passes a day (his bill line), has Duncan pay
# the bill and talks to the smuggler again; everything happens during the
# setup.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the story setup runs (the talks, a day, Duncan's payment)
checkpoint smugglers-end
quit
